      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غوّصهُ فِى المَآءِ</span></b>  <i>He made him to dive in,</i> or
<i>descend beneath, the water;</i> (A;) <i>he immersed,
immerged, dipped, plunged,</i> or <i>sunk, him therein.</i>
